OL,3,GNEWSA'Young people are expected to grow
OL,4,Aup without being shown how'
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoung people in Wolverhampton feel
OL,7,Funprepared for adult life, with many
OL,8,Fworried about their future, finances
OL,9,Fand the realities of growing up, new
OL,10,Fresearch suggests.
OL,12,FA survey of almost 4,000 teenagers
OL,13,Ffound many feel they are leaving
OL,14,Fchildhood without the practical skills,
OL,15,Fconfidence and support needed to
OL,16,Fnavigate adulthood.
OL,18,FYouth charity OnSide said young people
OL,19,Fare increasingly calling for help with
OL,20,Feveryday life skills, from managing
OL,21,Fmoney to planning their careers.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
